3962939054762990_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i58odriPNrcQ7kNvwFhOYSn&_nc_oc=AdryOv6D-Gpn12WwGw45vqYztuIZaVCItjBWJC-rwonTaPv5FZNY8dAgbnTUQEVNlYY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPgnr5v0180RPllYjpphEAhczK--PsdKrsz9DppZpkv5A&oe=6AD0E9E3"}, {"file_name": "SS 2.png", "id": "1062655706722494", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821796_1062655710055827_8972928903017092652_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3UVwsMtHC7sQ7kNvwFIBm_n&_nc_oc=AdqZFZYwR9iZSBmONhTKFy1l-GFXxe-NGuVG0J0NtHtJm3TgLwOBg97__HjkTQGERDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPN_HbgDctv9IDdX4ukmNYnOFb_xuEhkxn4ozZOBo4t1g&oe=6AD0E978"}, {"file_name": "SS 4.png", "id": "2704960216557859", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_2704960219891192_4330222625376527400_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q4WUVhhVxS4Q7kNvwFght_C&_nc_oc=AdpQxl5zwCay4HZfLYB52CF2oxtoq4NykBCi9xhofgRlK-RbxxhyCsZa6RLsNC91wLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNFmvP-4PHB0ix54ebrf5_e5RbaB2drL1CLW8x3Pl4S3Q&oe=6AD0E32E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x 1440x.png", "id": "900552703099018", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_900552706432351_5358088183613000666_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h8WE_rEe_OsQ7kNvwHvYSuZ&_nc_oc=AdqJyBs0djYTRImGA0srmS9oo76XMCNoCJt9MfwwAlVLooVISzNx3MYGpgajJG8sTps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPy0yie0Hhm450c9MEzqLvNrtDRV4qj9KT5h1pffh4u-g&oe=6AD0E790"}, "display_name": "Lost in Space Cosmic Rides", "keywords": ["relaxation", "VRride", "spaceexperience", "spacetravel", "cinematicexperience"], "long_description": "Step aboard and surrender to the stars.\nThis is not a game you play  it's a ride you experience. From the moment you take your seat, your spacecraft takes control, carrying you on a stunning 15-minute cinematic voyage across the universe. No buttons. No objectives. Just pure, jaw-dropping spectacle in every direction.\nFeel the true scale of the cosmos as you drift past towering planets. Hold your breath as two worlds collide before your eyes in a slow-motion ballet of destruction. Shield your eyes as the sun reaches the end of its life and erupts into a blinding explosion. Glide through asteroid fields, skim alien skies, and witness sights no human has ever seen  before your ship turns for home and carries you gently back to Earth.\nDesigned as a seated, hands-free experience, this ride is perfect for:\n\u2022 First-time VR users and families\n\u2022 Space and astronomy lovers\n\u2022 Showing friends and guests the magic of VR\n\u2022 Unwinding after a long day\nEvery moment is crafted for deep immersion \u2014 surround yourself with spatial audio, breathtaking celestial visuals, and a true sense of presence among the stars.\nAnd this is only the beginning. New rides and destinations will arrive in future updates \u2014 take your seat now and be there as the universe expands.\nOne seat. Fifteen minutes. A journey you will never forget.", "short_description": "Buckle up for a breathtaking 15-minute journey through the cosmos. No controls, no pressure just sit back as your spacecraft glides past colliding planets, a dying sun's final explosion, and alien worlds beyond imagination, before a gentle return to Earth. A fully cinematic VR ride built for pure immersion. Perfect for space lovers, first-time VR users, and anyone who wants to feel the true scale of the universe. Your seat is waiting. The universe is calling."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/lostinspace/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/lostinspace/", "category": null, "